and high dose radiation + 5-fluorouracil: The Gastrointestinal Tumor Study Group</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>1981</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>1705</fpage><lpage>1710</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7284971</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/1097-0142(19811015)48:8&#x0003c;1705::AID-CNCR2820480803&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-4</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kawakami</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Uno</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Isobe</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ueno</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Aruga</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Sudo</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Yamaguchi</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Saisho</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Kawata</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Ito</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Toxicities and effects of involved-field irradiation with concurrent cisplatin for unresectable carcinoma of the pancreas</article-title><source>Int J Radiat Oncol Biol Phys</source><year>2005</year><volume>62</volume><fpage>1357</fpage><lpage>1362</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16029793</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gunderson</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Kvols</surname><given-names>LK</given-names></name><name><surname>Nagorney</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Fieck</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Wieand</surname><given-names>HS</given-names></name><name><surname>Martinez</surname><given-names>